Crash Super Pro (crashsuperpro)
===============================

This project is a rewrite and expansion of the mod "Super-Creeper", which was written by First-sight
for Minecraft 1.20.1 (Forge). The original behaviour of that mod is preserved one to one, the code
has been re-organised into reusable pieces, and new monster mechanics were added on top of it.

    This project:      Crash Super Pro (mod id: crashsuperpro)
    Author:            FromtheArakiel
    Original project:  Super-Creeper
    Original author:   First-sight
    Original licence:  MIT

